# Tribunal "A Show of Power": Almalexia tells of a task (10), the End of Times
# preachers (20) and a priest found dead (30). Meralyn Othan in the Great Bazaar
# speaks of Sevil (40) and the End of Times (50); Eno Romari in Godsreach of the
# End of Times (55) and, through "beliefs", "making ourselves ready" and "great
# horror", the Cleansing (60). Almalexia, told of the End of Times and its
# beliefs, gives her lesson in power (70), names the Karstangz-Bcharn and gives
# the Dwemer Coherer for the ashstorms (80). In Bamz-Amschend's
# Skybreak Gallery the coherer goes in the junction box ("Yes" 0: 90,
# powerboxScript); with the power on, lever A up and B and C down make the
# machine call an ashstorm (95, tr_weathmachine), and Almalexia hears of it
# ("Karstangz-Bcharn": 100).
# The machine's ModRegion and ChangeWeather put an ashstorm over Mournhold
# Region, which the player sees in Godsreach. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's
# slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_champion --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_show_power
run
player->PositionCell 1 49 -659 0 "Mournhold Temple: High Chapel"
until 600 "almalexia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk almalexia
ask task
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 10
ask End of Times
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 20
ask found dead
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 30
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3262 -105 345 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 600 "meralyn othan"->GetDistance player < 400
talk meralyn othan
ask Sevil
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 40
ask End of Times
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1605 -498 234 0 "Mournhold, Godsreach"
until 600 "eno romari"->GetDistance player < 400
talk eno romari
ask End of Times
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 55
ask beliefs
ask making ourselves ready
ask great horror
ask the Cleansing
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 60
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1 49 -659 0 "Mournhold Temple: High Chapel"
until 600 "almalexia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk almalexia
ask End of Times
ask beliefs
ask lesson in power
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 70
ask Karstangz-Bcharn
ask Ashstorms in Mournhold
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 80
expect player->GetItemCount "misc_dwrv_weather" == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4224 3556 12432 0 "Bamz-Amschend, Skybreak Gallery"
until 300 GetPCCell "Bamz-Amschend, Skybreak Gallery" == 1
wait 300
activate 06473270
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 90
activate 065BBDD3
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 95
expect MournWeather == 7
run
player->PositionCell 1605 -498 234 0 "Mournhold, Godsreach"
until 600 GetCurrentWeather == 6
run
player->PositionCell 1 49 -659 0 "Mournhold Temple: High Chapel"
until 600 "almalexia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk almalexia
ask Karstangz-Bcharn
expect GetJournalIndex TR_ShowPower == 100
bye
end
